This software is supplied by AMS / Rehman Ahmed for use on the computer it is
installed on. You may install it on any number of machines that you personally
own or administer.

The software moves or copies the files you drop on it into the folders you
configure. It never uploads, inspects or transmits file contents; all file
handling happens locally. A move is performed in two verified steps: the item is
copied, its size is checked, and only then is the original removed. If anything
fails, the partial copy is deleted and the original is left untouched.

